@startuml flow-2-marketplace
title Flow 2: Marketplace - Publish, Buy & Payout\n(Seller and Buyer are Parent accounts; Specialist steps may also be done by Admin)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #000000
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #000000
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #000000
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555

|Seller|
|Specialist|
|System|
|Buyer|
|payOS|
|Admin|

|Seller|
start
:Apply as seller\n(Family plan with can_sell);
|Specialist|
if (Approve seller profile?) then (no)
  |Seller|
  :Profile rejected, may apply again;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Seller|
repeat
  :Submit a reviewed private story:\nprice 0 or 5,000-500,000 VND,\ngeneric name for each character;
  |System|
repeat while (Real names or family details left?) is (yes: 422, fix) not (no)
:Create de-personalized copy (no family story),\ncopy ready scene images and cover,\nregenerate narration with generic names,\nlisting = submitted;
|Specialist|
:Claim review (30 min, narration ready),\nview 100% of pages,\ncheck pedagogy checklist on the web;
if (Decision?) then (changes requested / rejected)
  |System|
  :listing = changes_requested / rejected\n(optional strike on reject, Flow 3);
  |Seller|
  :Fix the private story and submit again;
  stop
else (approved)
  |System|
  :listing = published;
  note right
    Later the Seller may submit a new version:
    same review; the old version stays on sale.
    On approval, entitlements, bookshelves, reviews
    and counters move to the new version, the old one
    is archived; narration of unchanged segments is reused.
  end note
endif
|Buyer|
:Browse marketplace\n(competency, age, price, sort);
:Buy one story;
|System|
:Create order, snapshot price\nand 80% seller share;
if (Price = 0?) then (no)
  |Buyer|
  :Pay by VietQR (link valid 15 min);
  |payOS|
  :Send signed webhook;
  |System|
  if (Signature, code and amount valid?) then (no)
    :Order failed / expired, nothing delivered;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
else (yes)
endif
|System|
:Order paid (conditional update, no double delivery);
if (Buyer already owns this story?) then (yes)
  :Deliver nothing, open a refund request\nautomatically (Flow 3b);
  stop
else (no)
endif
fork
  :Grant entitlement, purchase count + 1;
  |Buyer|
  :Add the story to a child's bookshelf\n(child reads it in Flow 4);
  :Rate the story after a child finished it;
fork again
  |System|
  :Record seller earning as pending (80%);
  :Cron: move to available after hold days\n(skipped while a refund is pending);
  |Seller|
  :Request withdrawal\n(bank set > 24 h ago, >= 50,000 VND);
  |System|
  :Hold the amount (available to locked);
  |Admin|
  if (Pay the seller?) then (yes)
    :Transfer by bank app,\nmark paid with transaction ref;
    |System|
    :Withdrawal paid (withdrawal_paid);
  else (no)
    |Admin|
    :Reject with reason;
    |System|
    :Return amount to available\n(withdrawal_release);
  endif
end fork
stop
@enduml
